{c: Verse 1}
[G#]Teri umeed tera
[G#]intezaar karte hain
[G#]Ae sanam hum to sirf
[C#m]tumse pyaar [G#]karte hain
[G#]Jaaneman hum bhi tumpe
[G#]jaan nisaar karte hain
[G#]Ae sanam hum to sirf
[C#m]tumse pyaar [G#]karte hain
[G#]Khwaab aankhon mein ab nahin aate
[G#]Ab to palkon mein tum samaaye ho
[G#]Har ghadi saath saath rehte ho
[G#]Dil ki duniya mein ghar basaaye ho
[G#]Dil ki [F#]duniya mein [G#]ghar basaaye ho
[G#]Teri har baat pe hum
[G#]aitbaar karte hain
[G#]Ae sanam hum to sirf
[C#m]tumse pyaar [G#]karte hain
[G#]Humko jis ki thi voh talash ho tum
[G#]Khushbu sanson ki dil ki pyas ho tum
[G#]Tere aashiq, tere deewane hain
[G#]Saari duniya se hum begaane hain
[G#]Saari duniya [F#]se hum [G#]begaane hain
[G#]Jaan hum pyaar tumhe
[G#]beshumaar karte hain
